>7).  Holy/Unholy water.  How do you make this stuff?  It's great for lots
>of things, but how can you get it?  I've found one, count 'em one, potion
>that turned out to be holy water, and one that turned out to be unholy.  

Drop any potion of water on a Lawful altar and it becomes holy water.  (This
might be considered an incentive not to convert Lawful altars even if you're
chaotic; I think it should be "altar of your own alignment," but since I'm
too lazy to hack the code, I bow to the superior wisdom of the Dev team.)

Or:  Let's say your inventory contains:

a. 1 holy water
b. 3 water
c. 5 unholy water.
d. 2 water (which you picked up  at some other point).

Drop d and pick it up.  You now have:

a. 1 holy water
b. 5 water
c. 5 unholy water.

Dip b in a:

b. 5 holy water
c. 5 unholy water

Dip c in b twice:

b. 3 holy water
c. 5 holy water

You can drop and pick up to consolidate.  On the other hand, you may be better
off not doing that, because that way if a Titan or something curses one batch,
the other is still good.





